{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>在美國買賣的港股預託證券，與本港收市比較，造價普遍較高。</p><p></p><p>滙豐控股收市折合148.37元，比本港收市高0.47元。工商銀行7.72元，高3仙。建設銀行10.03元，高5仙。友邦保險72.98元，高0.53元。港交所373.13元，高1.73元。</p><p></p><p>騰訊控股420.61元，高2.81元。阿里巴巴109.01元，高2.61元。理想汽車44.96元，高0.52元。金沙中國11.41元，高0.11元。長和65.21元，高0.21元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:54.308257+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":213,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T22:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T01:59:09.118207+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:47.471005+00:00","content_hash":"dca6fa510cbcaf9d4f98378bd12fb95954ed8b47cefe22787bda7922de33dae9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}